"+                ),","+                () -> runQuery(query, randomBoolean()).close()","+            );","+        } finally {","+            remote.execute(DeleteEnrichPolicyAction.INSTANCE, new DeleteEnrichPolicyAction.Request(TEST_REQUEST_TIMEOUT, policyName))","+                .actionGet();","+        }","+    }","+","+    public void testLookupJoinThenRemoteEnrichAfterRemoteEqlIsRejected() {","+        String query = REMOTE_EQL_SOURCE + \" | LOOKUP JOIN os_lookup ON os | ENRICH _remote:vendors ON os\";","+        expectThrows(","+            VerificationException.class,","+            containsString(\"can't be executed after [\" + REMOTE_EQL_SOURCE + \"]\"),","+            () -> runQuery(query, randomBoolean()).close()","+        );","+    }","+}"],"additions":168,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/CrossClusterInSubqueryIT.java","lines":["@@ -1161,6 +1161,30 @@ public void testEnrichWithRemoteModePolicyMixedScopesSucceeds() {","         }","     }"," ","+    public void testEnrichWithRemoteModePolicyAfterSubqueryWithStatsSucceeds() {","+        setupEnrichPolicy(client(REMOTE_CLUSTER_2), \"values_enrich_b\", 10);","+        setSkipUnavailable(REMOTE_CLUSTER_1, false);","+        setSkipUnavailable(REMOTE_CLUSTER_2, false);","+        try {","+            try (EsqlQueryResponse resp = runQuery(\"\"\"","+                FROM remote-b:logs-*","+                | WHERE v IN (","+                    FROM cluster-a:logs-*","+                    | WHERE v > 1 AND v < 7","+                    | STATS c = COUNT(*) BY v","+                    | KEEP v","+                  )","+                | ENRICH _remote:values_enrich_b ON v WITH enrich_name","+                | KEEP v","+                \"\"\", false)) {","+                assertThat(getValuesList(resp), equalTo(List.of(List.of(4L))));","+            }","+        } finally {","+            deleteEnrichPolicy(client(REMOTE_C